Hi <%= @first_name %>!

We're super excited to invite you to complete your onboarding materials for Hack Club's <%= @event_name %>. We enjoyed reviewing your projects, and now welcome you to <%= @location %> to join us for an amazing hackathon.

Complete your onboarding using Attend: <%= @onboarding_url %>

What does this include?
- You'll be asked to sign in with Hack Club Account - if you don't have one, it'll run you through the process automatically.
- You'll add information like your name, birthday, and your contact info as well as your medical information.
- You'll let us know how you're getting to <%= @location %> - plane, bus, car etc.
- You'll let us know your parent/guardian's email & contact details in case of emergency.

If you have any questions about this process, don't hesitate to email us at <%= @support_email %>, or just hit reply to this email!

We can't wait to see you at <%= @event_name %>!
